  "details": "Description\n\nCan no longer reposition menus by grabbing and dragging with trigger. This behavior was useful and now is gone and with no obvious replacement for moving the menu. Personally it'd be even better if the menu spawned at whatever angle you're looking in the first place\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nNo workaround, hold trigger on top bar of menu and move controller, nothing happens. idk why this has to be 100 chars it really is that simple\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
